      "speaker": "William F. Sullivan",
      "text": "All right. Next, is there any other serious matter or concern bearing on your service as a juror in this case that anybody needs to bring to my attention? All right. Thank you for following those instructions. And then in regards to today's schedule, we've got a number of witnesses. I'm not quite sure how long it may go. So we may break a little bit early today, just kind of depending on the way the case comes in. And then, in regards to where we are right now, we're going to, if you remember, when we broke on Friday, there was a witness, a Dr. Tufts. The Commonwealth had finished their direct examination. We're now going to have that witness return to the stand and the cross-examination by the defendant will begin. All right. And so with that, if we could recall that witness.",
      "event_types": [
        "jury_in",
        "recess",
        "direct_explicit",
        "cross_explicit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "locator": {
