        "url": null
      },
      "speaker": "Clerk",
      "text": "Good morning. Do you solemnly swear that the testimony and the evidence you shall give to the court and the jury in the matter now pending between the Commonwealth and the defendant shall be the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth, so help you God?",
      "event_types": [
        "oath"
      ]
    },
    {
      "locator": {
