        "url": null
      },
      "speaker": "Dr Jennifer Tufts",
      "text": "Well, she was assessed in the emergency room and was not admitted. And I assessed her on that day again. And while she was certainly struggling, she did not require hospitalization at that moment. So she was planning on going to the [inaudible 02:40:27] program, and I supported that.",
